  <p id="c-songshu-007-yinshuyi-ziluan-death:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">乙丑，撫軍將軍、南徐州刺史新安王<persName id="c-songshu-007-yinshuyi-ziluan-death:p001:m0016" ref="9b9_9ba_01d">子鸞</persName>解領司徒。</p>
  <p id="c-songshu-007-yinshuyi-ziluan-death:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">辛丑，撫軍將軍、南徐州刺史新安王<persName id="c-songshu-007-yinshuyi-ziluan-death:p002:m0016" ref="9b9_9ba_01d">子鸞</persName>免為庶人，賜死。</p>
